    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive the world and make it dance as you piece together the geometric puzzles and build the musical tracks together. Frequency is a Fast Paced Music based Geometric Puzzle Game where you must piece together different geometric pieces to build together musical tracks. Each piece pulses to different audio frequency spectrum bands from bass through the mid and treble, bringing you into the music. 40 Levels of different geometric and musical puzzles for you to solve, along with musical visualizers and a track selection.<br><br>Get ready to experience a puzzle game like no other\u2014where beats, colors, and strategy collide in perfect harmony! Frequency Sync blends the energy of dance music with brain-teasing puzzles, creating an immersive, rhythm-driven challenge that reacts to every move you make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb5 Solve Puzzles to the Beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level features a unique geometric puzzle that shifts and evolves in sync with the music. Your goal? Match patterns, shift colors, and time your moves to align with the beat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb6 Mesmerizing Music Visualizers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you play, dynamic visualizers pulse and transform based on the song\u2019s energy and your progress. Watch neon waves ripple, geometric shapes explode, and dazzling light shows unfold\u2014all influenced by your puzzle-solving skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0a A Soundtrack That Moves You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring an electrifying mix of dance, house, synthwave, and EDM tracks, Frequency Sync offers a sound-driven experience that keeps you engaged from start to finish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Available Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A demo is available now on Steam and Meta Quest! Experience the rhythm, solve the puzzles!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive the world and make it dance as you piece together the geometric puzzles and build the musical tracks together. Frequency is a Fast Paced Music based Geometric Puzzle Game where you must piece together different geometric pieces to build together musical tracks. Each piece pulses to different audio frequency spectrum bands from bass through the mid and treble, bringing you into the music. 40 Levels of different geometric and musical puzzles for you to solve, along with musical visualizers and a track selection.<br><br>Get ready to experience a puzzle game like no other\u2014where beats, colors, and strategy collide in perfect harmony! Frequency Sync blends the energy of dance music with brain-teasing puzzles, creating an immersive, rhythm-driven challenge that reacts to every move you make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb5 Solve Puzzles to the Beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level features a unique geometric puzzle that shifts and evolves in sync with the music. Your goal? Match patterns, shift colors, and time your moves to align with the beat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb6 Mesmerizing Music Visualizers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you play, dynamic visualizers pulse and transform based on the song\u2019s energy and your progress. Watch neon waves ripple, geometric shapes explode, and dazzling light shows unfold\u2014all influenced by your puzzle-solving skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0a A Soundtrack That Moves You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring an electrifying mix of dance, house, synthwave, and EDM tracks, Frequency Sync offers a sound-driven experience that keeps you engaged from start to finish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Available Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A demo is available now on Steam and Meta Quest! Experience the rhythm, solve the puzzles!</p>",
